+/**
+ * @file
+ *
+ * ACD IPv4 Address Conflict Detection
+ *
+ * This is an IPv4 address conflict detection implementation for the lwIP TCP/IP
+ * stack. It aims to be conform to RFC5227.
+ *
+ * @defgroup acd ACD
+ * @ingroup ip4
