+ * struct http_state instead of the heap.
+ * If enabled, you'll need to define MEMP_NUM_PARALLEL_HTTPD_CONNS
+ * (and MEMP_NUM_PARALLEL_HTTPD_SSI_CONNS for SSI) to set the size of
+ * the pool(s).
